ADR-0005 explicitly requires side effects to be suppressed during the wait and says the gate should include misalign and Spike lockstep. The current `tb_equiv.v` is narrower: it only compares PC/rd/wdata commit streams and misses bus transaction counts, CSR counter drift, and misalign behavior.
